<Positioned left="120" top="120"><Text fontSize="82" color="#2B2A28FF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">The Paper Boat</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="124" top="224"><Text fontSize="26" color="#6B5B45FF" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="NORMAL">Mira sets sail before breakfast, and the wind does the rest.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="124" top="268"><Text fontSize="18" color="#8A7A62FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">story and pictures made entirely with Snapshot DSL</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="120" top="1030"><Text fontSize="30" color="#FFFFFFF0" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="NORMAL">“Just to the lighthouse,” she said. “Before the gulls wake up.”</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1140" top="1160"><Text fontSize="20" color="#FFFFFFB8" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">page 4 · 小船出海</Text></Positioned>
